{"title":"Carrion Vulture","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 30 Vulture that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/carrion-vulture\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/carrion-vulture?lv=27\">Lv 27 <span>4</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/carrion-vulture?lv=28\">Lv 28 <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/carrion-vulture?lv=29\">Lv 29 <span>12</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/carrion-vulture?lv=30\">Lv 30 <span>7</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/carrion-vulture?lv=31\">Lv 31 <span>10</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/carrion-vulture?lv=32\">Lv 32 <span>13</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/carrion-vulture?lv=27\" title=\"Pick level 27\"><td><b>27</b></td><td>100</td><td>19.4</td><td>1,350</td><td class=\"muted\">300 · 27.2 · 4,050</td><td>4</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Thak%20Scout%20Outpost\">Thak Scout Outpost</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/carrion-vulture?lv=28\" title=\"Pick level 28\"><td><b>28</b></td><td>10